### Server-to-server calls made by the Suntec+ backend (never from the app).
### Create the key in Admin → API clients. Use the VS Code "REST Client" extension or copy into curl.
@host = http://localhost:3000
@key = sk_live_replace_me

### 1) Open Play & Win for a signed-in member → returns a single-use URL (60 s) for the WebView
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/sessions
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": "SUN-00010001",
  "entry": "home",
  "profile": { "first_name": "Ah Kow", "last_name": "Tan", "tier": "gold", "email": "tan.demo@example.com", "card_no": "6012000010001" }
}

### 2) Send a purchase at a participating merchant (idempotent on external_id)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/events
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "transaction",
  "external_id": "POS-2026-000123",
  "member_id": "SUN-00010001",
  "occurred_at": "2026-11-27T12:30:00+08:00",
  "payload": { "amount_cents": 6400, "merchant_code": "M-0101" }
}

### 3) Batch: mall visit + voucher redeemed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/events
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    { "type": "mall_visit", "external_id": "WIFI-88812", "member_id": "SUN-00010002" },
    { "type": "voucher_redeemed", "external_id": "VMS-RED-551", "member_id": "SUN-00010001", "payload": { "voucher_code": "DIN5-1A2B3C4D" } }
  ]
}

### 4) Grant 2 bonus spins (promotion), idempotent on external_id
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/members/SUN-00010001/attempts
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "game_id": "21000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "count": 2, "reason": "Spend $100 promotion", "external_id": "PROMO-777" }

### 5) Summary for the app home tile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/members/SUN-00010001/summary
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### 6) Scheduler (every 1–5 min): maintenance + Capillary/VMS/push delivery
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/tick
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-CRON_SECRET

### 7) A guest just signed up in the Suntec+ app with a Play & Win claim code → move their held winnings
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/members/SUN-00010003/claims
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "7K3M-Q9XD" }
